          <div class="cc-faq-a" style="padding:0 20px 18px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.62;color:var(--uw-ink-600);max-width:66ch;display:none">UWorld is still the gold-standard QBank for Step 3 and we recommend it. Amboss is optional. The crash course is the high-yield spine, UWorld is your application practice. Together they're the cleanest possible Step 3 stack.</div>
